ves a parametrization of the line segment $\\overset{―}{PQ},$ where $P(-1,1,3)$ and $Q(0,6,-1).$\n\n$$\nr(t)=a\\,i+(5t+1)\\,j+b\\,k,\\,t\\in [c,1]\n$$\n\nWhat is $a+b+c?$" :question/worked-solution "We need to find a direction vector that is parallel to the given line. We can use the vector $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\overset{\\to }{PQ} \\\\  & =\\overset{\\to }{OQ}-\\overset{\\to }{OP} \\\\  & =(6\\,j-k)-(-i+j+3\\,k) \\\\  & =i+5\\,j-4\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the vector equation of the line is\n\n$$\nr=p+tv\\,⟹\\,r=(-i+j+3\\,k)+t(i+5\\,j-4\\,k)\n$$\n\nand the parametrization of the line segment $\\overset{―}{PQ}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =(-i+j+3\\,k)+t(i+5\\,j-4\\,k) \\\\  & =(t-1)\\,i+(5t+1)\\,j+(3-4t)\\,k,\\,t\\in [0,1].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=(t-1)+(3-4t)+0=2-3t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-162177/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f78fe749-e37e-53f2-879f-4c36931c1d6f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-162177"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-162184/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "49d5d941-8d26-5a14-b4c5-3fd9b43ff98c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162184/selection/8919a1f1d5da5156b791cc24c75cdfdf0759e63108235cb5d327326441491b5b" :answer/id #uuid "ee4e9b21-a88f-5640-b301-5f5a2b519442" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162184/selection/a3c8468cbdc93324c4bae2d4a5fb6e7c888a9580ce1e8a437da5476b0ac8b2ff" :answer/id #uuid "60239240-08ee-55f4-bc03-d8b8444d03f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4t-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162184/selection/e0f366819c12742c47a6aef292714422c36cb7e1fb6aef7bfa86f2539d255646" :answer/id #uuid "254171cb-3f76-5317-9a4d-cd0e6615d80a" :answ